# Runs are private. The framework is open; what people put through it is not.
#
# A run carries real market research, named customers, pricing, and someone's
# unreleased product strategy. None of that is ours to publish. Only the README
# in each directory is tracked, so the directory survives a clone while its
# contents never leave the machine.
projects/*
!projects/README.md
examples/*
!examples/README.md

.DS_Store
node_modules/
__pycache__/
